<p>Hi <%= @greeting_name %>,</p>

<p>Unfortunately, your expense submission
(<%= link_to "##{@auto_number}", admin_reimbursements_expense_url(@record_id) %>) has been reviewed and
<strong>rejected</strong> for the following reason:</p>

<blockquote style="border-left: 4px solid #cc0000; margin: 1em 0; padding: 0.5em 1em; color: #333;">
  <%= @reason %>
</blockquote>

<p>The rejected expense was:</p>

<table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4" style="border-collapse: collapse; font-family: sans-serif;">
  <thead style="background-color: #f0f0f0;">
    <tr>
      <th scope="col">Amount</th>
      <th scope="col">Budget</th>
      <th scope="col">Description</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><%= reimbursements_money(@amount) %></td>
      <td><%= @budget_name %></td>
      <td><%= @description %></td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<p>If you believe this decision is incorrect, or you have addressed the reason above, reply to
this email and we can put the claim back in the queue. You can also
<%= link_to "file a new one", new_admin_reimbursements_expense_url %>, attaching the corrected receipt.</p>

<% if @cost_centre.contact_email %>
  <p>If you have any questions, contact us at <%= mail_to @cost_centre.contact_email %>.</p>
<% end %>

<p>Best,<br>
<%= @cost_centre.finance_sender_name %></p>
